# Print-in-place fit proof: the three bodies (leaf A, leaf B, free pin) must be
# geometrically separate. `fitcheck` renders every pairwise overlap and must be
# EMPTY (they clear — the pin is free, leaves don't rub). `fitcheck_neg` renders
# an oversized pin that MUST overlap the bores, proving the check can fail.
# This is the guard that catches the locked-hinge bug (a fused hinge scores
# 100/100 watertight; only this interference check sees it).
fitcheck      empty
fitcheck_neg  interferes
